                    The most important steps for caring for your ornamentals are:
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>maintain healthy, well-drained soil</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>improve soil with compost and organic matter</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>provide consistent moisture without overwatering</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
